WEBVTT

00:13:29.662 --> 00:13:31.579
I forgot my discretion.

00:13:31.579 --> 00:13:35.121
"Um, Abed," I said,

00:13:35.121 --> 00:13:38.162
"I thought you had a few
driving issues before the crash."

00:13:39.329 --> 00:13:42.162
"Well," he said, "I once went 60 in a 40."

00:13:42.954 --> 00:13:46.621
And so 27 violations --

00:13:46.662 --> 00:13:49.287
driving through a red light,
driving at excessive speed,

00:13:49.329 --> 00:13:51.204
driving on the wrong side of a barrier,

00:13:51.204 --> 00:13:53.496
and finally, riding his brakes
down that hill --

00:13:53.496 --> 00:13:55.037
reduced to one.

00:13:55.621 --> 00:13:58.912
And it was then I understood
that no matter how stark the reality,

00:13:58.954 --> 00:14:02.079
the human being fits it
into a narrative that is palatable.